{"server":"tw","storyId":"act17side_level_act17side_st12","groupId":"act17side","stageId":"act17side_10","title":"格蘭法洛","storyCode":"SN-ST-12","avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act17side/level_act17side_st12.txt","sourceHash":"0897734f880a9ead295026b7748ddd898883dec3a85e157feaf80a53d7004d5b","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g24_cloudy_sea"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼哈——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"上來！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_i36"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"快！抓住我的手！"},{"type":"narration","text":"一艘小船。\n這裡離伊比利亞之眼有多遠？離格蘭法洛有多遠？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"欸，啊，好的——！"},{"type":"narration","text":"艾麗妮握住了他的手。\n阿戈爾人的手和黎博利的沒有區別。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g24_cloudy_sea"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃——抱、抱歉——我力氣稍微有點小......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我遠遠看見那艘船爆炸的時候——真的嚇了一跳！你們還好嗎！？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你沒事就好。調整呼吸，總會游泳吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幸好現在還算風平浪靜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈啊......哈啊......其他人呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......確認一些事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剛才那是......阿戈爾？這麼近？斯圖提斐拉一直在阿戈爾城市的上面打轉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們也許可以想辦法回那座城市看看情況，可是你堅持不了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，隊長似乎也不太同意我們就這麼開開心心地回家。城市不會這麼靠近陸地，我對那座城市完全沒有記憶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......咳咳......哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，你們要，回到那座城市嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"不。歌蕾蒂婭說，這裡同時也是海嗣的領地。這座城市，是避難退居於此的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"被你們稱作島民的阿戈爾人，就是那些靠近陸地的城市崩潰後逃離的難民。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我們應該去幫助他們。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"兩件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"烏爾比安沒死，他也拒絕與我們同行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這附近還有其他的海嗣，它們被那場進化吸引而來，整個族群無比躁動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們可以趁現在殺回去，但我們再也出不來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我們......總算見到了故鄉的城市，現在，又要背對著它離開？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"歌蕾蒂婭無言地看了一眼斯卡蒂。\n她掩飾得很好。就像在一切靜謐的瞬間，她輕撫脖頸那時一樣掩飾得很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我們似乎別無選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡不該有一座城市。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們......我們應該回到岸邊，重整旗鼓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的職責是護衛阿戈爾，而不是，“回家”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g24_cloudy_sea"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎麼做到的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，啊，您和我說話？您指什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這艘船比我們的那艘還要簡陋。你怎麼確定我們的位置？這片大海如此寬廣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我......我比對了“愚人號”每一次發出信號的位置......發現了一些規律，所以我就想，呃......碰碰運氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"運氣？這個規律的軌跡誤差有多少？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，兩三百海里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這不能稱之為規律。如果你賭錯了，你幾乎沒有機會追上我們，你會死在海上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......真是個奇跡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那個......我想問一個問題......請審判官閣下不要笑我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我笑不出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我現在，是一個偉大的人嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_i29"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的祖父母，你的父母，喬迪，格蘭法洛的兩代人，他們都曾為了這個藍圖努力。他們本該......永遠偉大，真的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g24_cloudy_sea"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不算吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你只是個幸運兒罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈......是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老師......以及審判庭的其他同僚之間，總流傳著這樣的看法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只有犧牲者才配得上“偉大”一詞。在我們努力存活並為伊比利亞而戰的每一刻，我們都只是背負著巨大責任前行的普通人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"並非審判官們喜歡妄自菲薄。我們選擇最殘酷的方式對待伊比利亞，是因為鬆懈的瞬間我們就會被摧垮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是在那之前，只要人的意志能夠點亮這盞提燈，我想，我們就沒有差別。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像......那些以自己的方式苦苦掙扎的市民。那些還能留存善意的、為家園的復興甘願犧牲的戰士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......就像曾經格蘭法洛的工人們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......喬迪，幸運不會一直眷顧你的。如果你有機會再與審判庭接觸......呃。我是說，與我們合作——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——你會有機會的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哈哈......呃，我其實只是......那個，一時興起才問的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"各位從斯圖提斐拉帶回了不朽的知識，各位才是真正的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你一口氣救下了三位深海獵人。作為阿戈爾人，你甚至可以以此受到執政官本人的表彰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"......遊回去，會很吃力。而且在它們的巢穴上方，沒人知道會發生什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不太明白格蘭法洛出生的你到底有什麼執念......但是，做得不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以阿戈爾人......以及伊比利亞人的角度來說都是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我們回家吧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g19_lighthouse_front"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"歡迎回來，獵人們。還有，艾麗妮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......長官他......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你怎麼知道的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們已經整理好他的遺物。包括那些戰死在燈塔下的同志一併。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在懲戒軍抵達之前，我們沒有辦法處置他們的遺物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"低等恐魚無法擊敗大審判官達里奧，但為了守護伊比利亞之眼，他選擇以生命拖延時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"審判官沒有時間哀傷，艾麗妮。達里奧對你寄予厚望，你必須前進下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......但是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他的提燈還完好無損，就放在那裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來懲戒軍遇到了一些麻煩。我並沒有看見伊比利亞引以為傲的海上軍事力量。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......“愚人號”沉沒了。這個結果並非我們所預想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。這對我們來說，無疑算作一次挫折。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......但我們得到了更多的消息，以及......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們發現了阿戈爾的城市。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凱爾希已經與我分享了她的推測，也許你也該聽一聽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"審判庭一直堅信能控制一切。從鹽風城，到斯圖提斐拉......我們會逐步奪回屬於伊比利亞的榮光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但也許，我們不得不承認，即使是保持現狀，也足以讓審判庭......捉襟見肘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"執政官閣下——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們在那艘船上見到了什麼？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g20_lighthouse_core"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......提燈。這是長官的提燈......焦黑，還有恐魚的氣味......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......長官......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老師！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我完成了審判庭的任務！！找到了斯圖提斐拉號！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"儘管它不幸沉沒！但——船上的——每一個伊比利亞人！都以自己的方式，抗爭到了最後！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"長官！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已經——理解了審判的含義，理解了我們所面對的敵人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我——不會猶豫，也不會怯懦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是為了伊比利亞的存續，為了同伊比利亞的敵人而戰，為了守衛伊比利亞的潔淨與德行，提起了劍與燈！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g19_lighthouse_front"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......阿方索他......這不可能！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"六十多年，這是怎麼樣的折磨！接受最殘酷刑罰的罪犯，也撐不過一年！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他......他......"},{"type":"narration","text":"卡門漸漸沉默。他彎下了腰，坐在礁石上。\n恐魚的屍體堆積成山。這裡再也沒有一丁點異類的痕跡，只有殘餘的溟痕，退向大海，讓海面散發出淡淡的藍光，搶奪了天空的特權。\n他本該勝利了。他做到了審判庭一直以來想做的事情。懲戒軍即將抵達，這一切都趨於美滿。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"但他只是沉默。\n直到遠方傳來轟鳴的汽笛聲。懲戒軍抵達了伊比利亞之眼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g26_dusk_wild"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可以從這裡看見小鎮的角落。我記得，這座山丘叫做......重建丘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蒂亞戈並不是平靜地死去的，我並不知道那是好是壞......但......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"感謝各位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別在意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在一場肅穆的葬禮上，為英雄獻上一曲，也不是什麼壞事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty","isRemote":false,"text":"Frost似乎回來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。我們一會就回去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你呢？這些日子，你受了不少苦吧，伊比利亞人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"格蘭法洛是蒂亞戈的家鄉。阿戈爾是各位，以及我那些深海獵人朋友們的家鄉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也許平時玩笑開太多，大家都忘啦......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊比利亞也是我的家鄉。說真的，我現在心裡並不是滋味。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個醫生沒打算幫你做點什麼嗎？你不是替她工作的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我們已經做了。這也是我願意留在羅德島的原因嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我自己還什麼都沒做呢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g17_lighthouse_alley"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"緊張的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_460_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快、快！把物資搬進倉庫！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"緊張的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_460_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，帳篷的數量呢？那位老爺不是交代過嗎！？唔——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"緊張的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_460_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喬、喬迪？你回來了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"緊張的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_460_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼......審判庭竟然把你抓了又放回來了？你去哪了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"緊張的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_460_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有好多懲戒軍把我們帶走，我們又跟著他們回到小鎮......他們好像在和什麼東西打仗，現在他們要我們幫忙搭帳篷啥的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"緊張的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_460_1","isRemote":false,"text":"格蘭法洛會變成什麼樣？呃，還有，你看見蒂亞戈了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喬迪·方塔納羅薩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"緊張的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_460_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......聖、聖徒大人......還有審判官閣下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓我們與這位阿戈爾人單獨聊一聊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"緊張的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_460_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，當然！您請！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跟我來。隨便走走吧，在這座小鎮上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g18_lighthouse_square"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"艾麗妮在回程的路上做出了決定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"決、決定？什麼決定？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"本來，按照大審判官達里奧的想法，他意欲將艾麗妮託付於我，由我栽培，直到她能勝任大審判官的席位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"達里奧的戰死在預料之外——這一天遲早會來臨，但達里奧本不必如此之快地接受命運。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是艾麗妮下定了決心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她將，放棄審判官的職位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！呃，什麼？為什麼！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是我自己的決定。我有我自己的考慮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些與你無關，請接著聽下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊。好的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"問題在你，阿戈爾人。你知道太多，深入太多，而這座小鎮裡的阿戈爾人，也褻瀆太多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你也幫了我們許多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"脆弱如你，本是死也如沙粒般渺小的。但你卻，展現了力量。即使那只是你自己小小的火種，也難能可貴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我只是在想......自己為什麼活著，我沒有各位這麼高尚，也不堅定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喬迪，你將會......成為第一位加入審判庭的阿戈爾人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃？欸？我？加入審判庭？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嚴格來說，你沒有拒絕的機會。格蘭法洛需要更多人手，而一個阿戈爾人，將起到舉足輕重的作用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在這之後，嗯，也許我還需要一位年輕的書記......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，我？加入審判庭？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我並不想......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道你不想。很多審判庭成員，以及那些對阿戈爾的偏見根深蒂固的人，同樣不想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可你不想看看......伊比利亞曾經許諾給格蘭法洛，許諾給蒂亞戈的那個未來嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"加入審判庭是一次考驗。作為阿戈爾人，你當做苦行或是磨難也沒差。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別誤會了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我......我考慮一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那，審判官閣下呢？您的老師......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"審判官的身份不利於我與深海獵人，甚至阿戈爾接觸，所以我才拋棄了它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拋棄一段支撐我至今的信念......在老師不幸戰死後拋棄它，並不是一件輕鬆的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請......請暫時不要追問更多了。如果我們之後還能相遇，那時再說吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是......"},{"type":"narration","text":"艾麗妮看向了廣場中的雕塑。一個縮小版的伊比利亞之眼。\n在戰亂中破碎的街道，毀壞的房屋，臨時搭建的帳篷。\n它始終看著這一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即使我們面對的已經遠超律法的範疇，伊比利亞也必將清算這些褻瀆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們必將獲勝。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibchurch"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"Frost，請允許我表達我的謝意。你幫了喬迪，也幫了獵人們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"npc_2003_Frost_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒什麼，只是體能訓練。能改變浪尖方向的，不只是那些不聽話的壞孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"npc_2003_Frost_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下次，記得來捧場。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我會的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"npc_2003_Frost_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，我得去找Aya她們了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"npc_2003_Frost_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是出個門，就不見了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"npc_2003_Frost_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（略感不滿的獨奏）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"npc_2003_Frost_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了。凱爾希......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"npc_2003_Frost_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們已經來了，我們總不能白來一趟。等你做好準備，我們隨時可以醒來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"npc_2003_Frost_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Aya會這麼說的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......感謝你們。我們遲早會真正建立起合作關係。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"npc_2003_Frost_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（表別離的獨奏）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，這就是布雷奧甘發現的真相。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“巨獸”“海神”。它們之間的聯繫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果海洋從很久以前就沒有了這些巨大的生物，而它們都以這種形式在陸地上生存——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"並不相同，歌蕾蒂婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"大炎、薩爾貢、薩米，這些地方都曾面臨過由巨獸引發的問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，記住。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"海洋的異變有其無可取代的特殊性。即使是我，也不知道其具體的原理和軌跡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我只能看見結果，再推測未來。那一定是一個糟糕的未來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，我想，布雷奧甘還推斷出了其他的真相。而如果如你所說，還有一位深海獵人活著的話......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"海神不止一隻。我們殺死的那一隻，只是阿戈爾文明所遮掩的一小部分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你們殺死的那隻，就活在斯卡蒂的身體裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼我最糟糕的猜想成真了。你沒有選擇返回阿戈爾，是正確的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島已經幫了我們許多，你們也有自己的任務，接下來，我們會自行解決。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島......有羅德島的職責。我們最優秀的幹員，會維持羅德島的運行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"可在這數萬年的歲月裡，我也有我的職責。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"很多次很多次，我都試圖去解決阿戈爾面臨的問題。但阿戈爾，遠離大地，獨樹一幟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我們不能再拖延了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"海洋的問題與源石已是同等級別。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_0"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"如果文明想要延續，我們就必須戰勝這場浩劫。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_kxstreet"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"儘管這個世界仍舊紛爭不斷，隔閡與戰火從未停歇，正如斯圖提斐拉其名。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltstreet1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"泰拉既載滿了弊病與愚昧的癡人，也載滿從癲狂與無序中尋找理性的聖徒。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibchurch"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"現在，你已經知道了進化的源頭，驗證了所有想法。阿戈爾的城市已經觸手可及，傲慢如伊比利亞也放棄了作繭自縛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"總戰爭設計師閣下，開始吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g24_cloudy_sea"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅辛南特","speakerId":"avg_npc_463_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（不滿地搖擺脖頸）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"安分點，羅辛南特。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅辛南特","speakerId":"avg_npc_463_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（更大幅度地搖擺脖頸）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"最後的騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_448_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......羅辛南特......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅辛南特","speakerId":"avg_npc_463_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（嘶鳴）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我們要去哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"最後的騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_448_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巨浪，即將來臨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"最後的騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_448_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們，戰勝巨浪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"最後的騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_448_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們，即是巨浪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巨浪。只要海裡還有水，天上還有月亮，空中還有風，浪濤就不會平息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在瘋狂中窺見的目標，還真是過度雄偉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"最後的騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_448_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走！（沙啞的咆哮）走吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅辛南特","speakerId":"avg_npc_463_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（歡快的嘶鳴）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"最後的騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_448_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（沙啞的咆哮）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"最後的騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_448_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不允許，海，再有丁點漣漪！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"最後的騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_448_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去吧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_003_kalts","aliases":["凱爾希"]},{"speakerId":"char_263_skadi","aliases":["斯卡蒂"]}]}
